  "assets": [
    {
      "uuid": "2b5e3219-bdcd-450d-8b5e-3219bdcd750d",
      "name": "Getting Started.md",
      "path": "Assets/Tutorials/Getting Started.md",
      "assetType": "other",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "byteLength": 1082,
      "source": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: empty\n---\n# Welcome to Physics and world panel audit\n\nThis project was created from the **empty** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nCreate objects in Design, then press Play. The empty scene intentionally has no game controls.\n\n### Expected result\n\nAn empty scene is ready for your first object; an empty Game preview is expected.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nObjekte in Design erstellen, dann Play starten. Die leere Szene hat absichtlich keine Spielsteuerung.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nEine leere Szene ist für das erste Objekt bereit; eine leere Spielansicht ist korrekt.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n在设计工作区创建对象后播放。空场景没有预设游戏操作。\n\n### 预期结果\n\n创建空场景后即可添加第一个对象；空白游戏预览是预期结果。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用\n",
      "sourceModified": 0,
      "importedAt": 0,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "duration": 0,
      "fontFamily": "",
      "settings": {
        "filterMode": "Linear",
        "compression": "Lossless",
        "pixelsPerUnit": 100,
        "spriteRegion": null,
        "pivot": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5
        },
        "atlas": false
      },
      "pipeline": {
        "importerVersion": "template-4.2",
        "platform": "web",
        "sourceHash": "f5fdadce9e7be772494225db1f102c3338fa2c21da8cab7943d96e2fdecd9329",
        "artifactHash": "f5fdadce9e7be772494225db1f102c3338fa2c21da8cab7943d96e2fdecd9329",
        "contentHash": "f5fdadce9e7be772494225db1f102c3338fa2c21da8cab7943d96e2fdecd9329",
        "cacheKey": "f5fdadce9e7be772494225db1f102c3338fa2c21da8cab7943d96e2fdecd9329",
        "status": "ready",
        "lastValidSource": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: empty\n---\n# Welcome to Physics and world panel audit\n\nThis project was created from the **empty** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nCreate objects in Design, then press Play. The empty scene intentionally has no game controls.\n\n### Expected result\n\nAn empty scene is ready for your first object; an empty Game preview is expected.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nObjekte in Design erstellen, dann Play starten. Die leere Szene hat absichtlich keine Spielsteuerung.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nEine leere Szene ist für das erste Objekt bereit; eine leere Spielansicht ist korrekt.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n在设计工作区创建对象后播放。空场景没有预设游戏操作。\n\n### 预期结果\n\n创建空场景后即可添加第一个对象；空白游戏预览是预期结果。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用\n",
        "error": "",
        "dependencies": [],
        "reverseDependencies": [],
        "cacheHit": false
      }
    }
  ],
